{
 "slug": "the-stablecoin-duopoly-and-limits",
 "title": "The Stablecoin Duopoly and Limits of Interchangeability",
 "subtitle": "Circle and Tether run the same basic playbook and made opposite regulatory bets. Here's why.",
 "post_date": "2026-08-03T00:31:03.680Z",
 "body_html": "<h2>The Puzzle</h2><p>Stablecoins appear to be a fungible commodity with network effects. Consistent with this, the $300B<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a> dollar-denominated stablecoin market is dominated by its two largest players: Circle and Tether, who enjoy an ~83% market share. A straightforward instance of winner-takes-all dynamics. But the divergent approaches these duopolists have taken in their product and regulatory strategies break down the characterization of stablecoins as interchangeable.</p><p>Nowhere is this clearer than in each company\u2019s recent decisions. Circle pursued and secured MiCA authorization; Tether chose not to pursue it and was unceremoniously delisted from all major European exchanges. </p><p>For two companies that appear to have the same playbook, hold a pool of reserves and issue stablecoins against it, this reads as incoherent. What gives?</p><h2>History </h2><p>Circle and Tether were founded one year apart, by people solving different problems. </p><p>Founded in 2013, Circle was created to help build the internet economy. Its first product wasn\u2019t a stablecoin, but a consumer bitcoin wallet, and USDC didn\u2019t launch until 2018. This gap allowed Circle to spend its first two years courting regulators before it needed to. And that credibility, beginning with Circle\u2019s BitLicense acquisition in 2015, compounded into an IPO, MiCA licensing, and OCC charter. By the time USDC needed institutional trust, Circle already had it.</p><p>What Circle didn\u2019t have was distribution. In 2018, Circle turned to Coinbase to create CENTRE, a consortium that issued USDC and governed its standards. Coinbase provided the distribution, Circle the operations, and the two split reserve income. In 2023, when CENTRE was dismantled, Circle bought Coinbase out with $209.9M<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-2\" href=\"#footnote-2\" target=\"_self\">2</a> of stock, agreed to share 100% of its reserve income from USDC held in Coinbase\u2019s ecosystem, and split all other reserve income 50/50. </p><p>Tether was founded in 2014, and quickly taken over by Bitfinex executives searching for a dollar substitute. At this time, crypto exchanges were struggling to secure or maintain banking relationships and needed a replacement.</p><p>Tether began with the distribution Circle had to fight for, through Bitfinex. USDT launched as \u201crealcoin\u201d in the same year, four years before USDC existed. That head start allowed Tether to embed into spot liquidity without competition. This carried into the 2019-2020 build-out of USDT-margined perpetuals. By the time Circle launched USDC in 2018, USDT already had ~$2B in circulation. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DPvy!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd1acc7b5-4da4-4732-b124-03d448eaa8fd_2400x1500.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DPvy!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd1acc7b5-4da4-4732-b124-03d448eaa8fd_2400x1500.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DPvy!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd1acc7b5-4da4-4732-b124-03d448eaa8fd_2400x1500.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DPvy!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd1acc7b5-4da4-4732-b124-03d448eaa8fd_2400x1500.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DPvy!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd1acc7b5-4da4-4732-b124-03d448eaa8fd_2400x1500.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DPvy!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd1acc7b5-4da4-4732-b124-03d448eaa8fd_2400x1500.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"910\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d1acc7b5-4da4-4732-b124-03d448eaa8fd_2400x1500.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:910,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:264238,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://willjensen.substack.com/i/209401037?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd1acc7b5-4da4-4732-b124-03d448eaa8fd_2400x1500.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DPvy!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd1acc7b5-4da4-4732-b124-03d448eaa8fd_2400x1500.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DPvy!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd1acc7b5-4da4-4732-b124-03d448eaa8fd_2400x1500.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DPvy!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd1acc7b5-4da4-4732-b124-03d448eaa8fd_2400x1500.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DPvy!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd1acc7b5-4da4-4732-b124-03d448eaa8fd_2400x1500.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Launching with immediate ecosystem integration had a cost, however. In 2019, Bitfinex\u2014under the same parent company as Tether\u2014lost access to a payment processor and covered the resulting shortfall using Tether\u2019s reserves.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-3\" href=\"#footnote-3\" target=\"_self\">3</a> Rather than disclosing the commingling and resulting gap, Tether represented USDT as fully backed when it wasn\u2019t. Consequently, the few banking relationships Tether did have disappeared. </p><p>Circle built credibility without adoption. Tether built adoption, but lost the credibility to match it.</p><h2>Consequences </h2><p>These differences in credibility and adoption can be observed in the chain geography of USDC and USDT. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!itVE!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f17a94e-e252-44d3-9808-dc9acf11cb1c_2400x1536.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!itVE!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f17a94e-e252-44d3-9808-dc9acf11cb1c_2400x1536.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!itVE!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f17a94e-e252-44d3-9808-dc9acf11cb1c_2400x1536.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!itVE!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f17a94e-e252-44d3-9808-dc9acf11cb1c_2400x1536.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!itVE!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f17a94e-e252-44d3-9808-dc9acf11cb1c_2400x1536.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!itVE!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f17a94e-e252-44d3-9808-dc9acf11cb1c_2400x1536.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"932\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5f17a94e-e252-44d3-9808-dc9acf11cb1c_2400x1536.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:932,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:320117,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://willjensen.substack.com/i/209401037?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f17a94e-e252-44d3-9808-dc9acf11cb1c_2400x1536.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!itVE!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f17a94e-e252-44d3-9808-dc9acf11cb1c_2400x1536.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!itVE!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f17a94e-e252-44d3-9808-dc9acf11cb1c_2400x1536.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!itVE!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f17a94e-e252-44d3-9808-dc9acf11cb1c_2400x1536.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!itVE!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5f17a94e-e252-44d3-9808-dc9acf11cb1c_2400x1536.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>This credibility/liquidity divide is perhaps best illustrated with Hyperliquid, the largest on-chain perpetual futures exchange ($10B+ of open interest). The exchange\u2019s margin balances are funded with USDC, but its oracles quote prices in USDT.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-4\" href=\"#footnote-4\" target=\"_self\">4</a> </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eGI3!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b05b615-ba5a-48a0-87a3-00b9e4b4d9da_2400x1608.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eGI3!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b05b615-ba5a-48a0-87a3-00b9e4b4d9da_2400x1608.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eGI3!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b05b615-ba5a-48a0-87a3-00b9e4b4d9da_2400x1608.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eGI3!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b05b615-ba5a-48a0-87a3-00b9e4b4d9da_2400x1608.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eGI3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b05b615-ba5a-48a0-87a3-00b9e4b4d9da_2400x1608.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eGI3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b05b615-ba5a-48a0-87a3-00b9e4b4d9da_2400x1608.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"976\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3b05b615-ba5a-48a0-87a3-00b9e4b4d9da_2400x1608.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:976,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:392285,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://willjensen.substack.com/i/209401037?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b05b615-ba5a-48a0-87a3-00b9e4b4d9da_2400x1608.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eGI3!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b05b615-ba5a-48a0-87a3-00b9e4b4d9da_2400x1608.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eGI3!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b05b615-ba5a-48a0-87a3-00b9e4b4d9da_2400x1608.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eGI3!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b05b615-ba5a-48a0-87a3-00b9e4b4d9da_2400x1608.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eGI3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b05b615-ba5a-48a0-87a3-00b9e4b4d9da_2400x1608.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>It should be noted that these tendencies aren\u2019t absolute. As indicated above, USDT enjoys a majority share of collateral on Aave. USDC-margined perpetuals trade on Bybit and Kraken. Coinbase\u2019s L2, Base, led all chains in adjusted stablecoin volume at $565B<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-5\" href=\"#footnote-5\" target=\"_self\">5</a>, just ahead of Ethereum\u2019s $562B and TRON\u2019s $320B, and combines payments, DeFi rebalancing, and more. All with USDC as its primary stablecoin.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HSea!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F016097ff-85f2-4e29-9097-b5b4578ab07b_2400x1740.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HSea!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F016097ff-85f2-4e29-9097-b5b4578ab07b_2400x1740.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HSea!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F016097ff-85f2-4e29-9097-b5b4578ab07b_2400x1740.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HSea!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F016097ff-85f2-4e29-9097-b5b4578ab07b_2400x1740.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HSea!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F016097ff-85f2-4e29-9097-b5b4578ab07b_2400x1740.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HSea!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F016097ff-85f2-4e29-9097-b5b4578ab07b_2400x1740.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1056\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/016097ff-85f2-4e29-9097-b5b4578ab07b_2400x1740.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1056,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:279712,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://willjensen.substack.com/i/209401037?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F016097ff-85f2-4e29-9097-b5b4578ab07b_2400x1740.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HSea!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F016097ff-85f2-4e29-9097-b5b4578ab07b_2400x1740.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HSea!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F016097ff-85f2-4e29-9097-b5b4578ab07b_2400x1740.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HSea!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F016097ff-85f2-4e29-9097-b5b4578ab07b_2400x1740.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HSea!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F016097ff-85f2-4e29-9097-b5b4578ab07b_2400x1740.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>The point is that history has shaped these use case distributions. USDT\u2019s numeraire dominance is the result of a multi-year, multi-billion-dollar spot market head start that meant a deeper pool to build on when USDT perpetuals became the standard derivatives product in 2019 and 2020. USDC\u2019s credit-provisioning dominance is a result of the incentives of a protocol or treasury holding a stablecoin as collateral. These actors are underwriting issuer insolvency directly, for as long as the position remains open, unlike a trader briefly quoting a price. Credibility matters more here not because traders discount it, but because duration converts the same tail risk into a larger expected loss, and because deep liquidity lets a short-duration holder exit fast in a way a locked collateral position can\u2019t. </p><h2>Today</h2><p>In 2015, the regulatory ecosystem surrounding stablecoins was nascent and undeveloped. This is no longer true. MiCA and the GENIUS Act both exist now and are explicit in their requirements. Tether\u2019s reserve pool is not compliant. Of its $187B in assets, ~75% are held in the HQLA that both frameworks require, but the remaining 25% is held in gold, bitcoin, secured loans, equity in public companies, and corporate bonds. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e3sq!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbbe999c3-6807-43d7-99ae-ee61ea318f75_2400x1360.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e3sq!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbbe999c3-6807-43d7-99ae-ee61ea318f75_2400x1360.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e3sq!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbbe999c3-6807-43d7-99ae-ee61ea318f75_2400x1360.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e3sq!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbbe999c3-6807-43d7-99ae-ee61ea318f75_2400x1360.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e3sq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbbe999c3-6807-43d7-99ae-ee61ea318f75_2400x1360.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e3sq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbbe999c3-6807-43d7-99ae-ee61ea318f75_2400x1360.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"825\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/bbe999c3-6807-43d7-99ae-ee61ea318f75_2400x1360.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:825,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:222776,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://willjensen.substack.com/i/209401037?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbbe999c3-6807-43d7-99ae-ee61ea318f75_2400x1360.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e3sq!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbbe999c3-6807-43d7-99ae-ee61ea318f75_2400x1360.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e3sq!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbbe999c3-6807-43d7-99ae-ee61ea318f75_2400x1360.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e3sq!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbbe999c3-6807-43d7-99ae-ee61ea318f75_2400x1360.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e3sq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbbe999c3-6807-43d7-99ae-ee61ea318f75_2400x1360.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Closing this reserve composition gap is, on the face of it, not insurmountable. Tether could liquidate the positions and purchase treasuries or similar in their place. Why doesn\u2019t it? This non-compliant 25% is what allows Tether to take directional (and volatile) positions, and earn above the risk-free rate its competitors\u2019 reserves are bound to. In Q2 2026, Tether\u2019s gold and bitcoin positions lost money, and its reserve buffer halved. So, the strategy does not always work. But in Q1 2024, ~80% of Tether\u2019s $4.5B earnings came from gold and bitcoin mark-to-market gains. This barbell-like strategy, where majority HQLA reserves are complemented by risk-on assets that offer asymmetric upside at the cost of volatility, is a feature, not a bug, of Tether\u2019s business. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3bhj!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe8949465-2da0-4e93-899d-085134a0b78e_2400x1600.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3bhj!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe8949465-2da0-4e93-899d-085134a0b78e_2400x1600.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3bhj!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe8949465-2da0-4e93-899d-085134a0b78e_2400x1600.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3bhj!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe8949465-2da0-4e93-899d-085134a0b78e_2400x1600.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3bhj!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe8949465-2da0-4e93-899d-085134a0b78e_2400x1600.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3bhj!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe8949465-2da0-4e93-899d-085134a0b78e_2400x1600.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"971\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e8949465-2da0-4e93-899d-085134a0b78e_2400x1600.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:971,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:249317,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://willjensen.substack.com/i/209401037?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe8949465-2da0-4e93-899d-085134a0b78e_2400x1600.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3bhj!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe8949465-2da0-4e93-899d-085134a0b78e_2400x1600.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3bhj!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe8949465-2da0-4e93-899d-085134a0b78e_2400x1600.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3bhj!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe8949465-2da0-4e93-899d-085134a0b78e_2400x1600.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3bhj!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe8949465-2da0-4e93-899d-085134a0b78e_2400x1600.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Instead of altering its reserve core, Tether has created USAT<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-6\" href=\"#footnote-6\" target=\"_self\">6</a>, a white-labeled, GENIUS-compliant stablecoin issued by Anchorage Digital Bank and custodied by Cantor Fitzgerald. To a similar end, in Europe, Tether holds stakes in multiple MiCA-compliant stablecoin issuers (StablR and Quantoz), and has led a funding round for a Spanish exchange, Bit2Me.</p><p>The differences between Circle\u2019s and Tether's financials extend beyond balance sheet items. In Q1 2026, Circle posted operating expenses of $242M (GAAP), or roughly $136M excluding stock-based compensation. Tether is a private company, but its opex can be approximated through gross yield less reported net profit and is likely much lower. Some of that gap is simply the ordinary cost of being a regulated, audited, public company. That gap is separate from, and smaller than, Circle's other major cost of scale: its revenue-sharing arrangement with Coinbase that cost $305M in Q1 2026 alone.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!cOb7!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F228fb37e-e6b2-4121-8803-da9a28b0b2f8_2400x1520.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!cOb7!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F228fb37e-e6b2-4121-8803-da9a28b0b2f8_2400x1520.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!cOb7!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F228fb37e-e6b2-4121-8803-da9a28b0b2f8_2400x1520.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!cOb7!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F228fb37e-e6b2-4121-8803-da9a28b0b2f8_2400x1520.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!cOb7!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F228fb37e-e6b2-4121-8803-da9a28b0b2f8_2400x1520.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!cOb7!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F228fb37e-e6b2-4121-8803-da9a28b0b2f8_2400x1520.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"922\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/228fb37e-e6b2-4121-8803-da9a28b0b2f8_2400x1520.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:922,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:265946,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://willjensen.substack.com/i/209401037?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F228fb37e-e6b2-4121-8803-da9a28b0b2f8_2400x1520.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!cOb7!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F228fb37e-e6b2-4121-8803-da9a28b0b2f8_2400x1520.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!cOb7!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F228fb37e-e6b2-4121-8803-da9a28b0b2f8_2400x1520.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!cOb7!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F228fb37e-e6b2-4121-8803-da9a28b0b2f8_2400x1520.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!cOb7!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F228fb37e-e6b2-4121-8803-da9a28b0b2f8_2400x1520.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Arc, an L1 blockchain backed by $200M+ of capital from a16z, BlackRock, Apollo, ICE, and others, is Circle's attempt to build a revenue line that doesn't run through Coinbase at all. Where USAT hedges a compliance gap, Arc extends the credibility Circle already has into new infrastructure.</p><h2>Moving Forward</h2><p>Circle and Tether pursued different regulatory strategies because their histories set them on different paths. For Circle, GENIUS and MiCA compliance is a continuation of a precedent it set over a decade ago. For Tether, compliance means dismantling an asset mix it established intentionally as a way to diversify out of a pure HQLA reserve pool that excludes the possibility of convex returns.</p><p>None of this means the current split is settled. History explains how Circle and Tether arrived at their current positions, not where they\u2019re going. USDC\u2019s growth rate has outpaced that of USDT for most of the past two years, though both have cooled off sharply in recent months. If liquidity begets liquidity, as is so often asserted, this growth rate gap may spell a future reversal of the two company\u2019s standings. There\u2019s also the entrance of other stablecoins, most notably Open Standard\u2019s OUSD, and tokenized monies in general (deposits and MMFs) as competition.</p><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-1\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-1\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">1</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://defillama.com/stablecoins</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-2\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-2\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">2</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1876042/000119312525126208/d737521ds1a.htm</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-3\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-3\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">3</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://ag.ny.gov/sites/default/files/2021.02.17_-_settlement_agreement_-_execution_version.b-t_signed-c2_oag_signed.pdf</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-4\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-4\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">4</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://hyperliquid.gitbook.io/hyperliquid-docs/trading/contract-specifications</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-5\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-5\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">5</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://visaonchainanalytics.com/transactions</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-6\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-6\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">6</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://tether.io/news/tether-announces-the-launch-of-usat-the-federally-regulated-dollar-backed-stablecoin-made-in-america/</p></div></div>",
